<title>USA: Diamond Offshore files $600 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>Diamond Offshore files $600 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diamond Offshore Drilling Inc said Friday it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $600 million in debt securities, preferred and common stock and warrants.  </p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, including repayment of borrowings, working capital, capital expenditures and acquisitions.</p>
<p>Diamond, based in Houston, Texas, is engaged in contract drilling of offshore oil and gas wells and in deep water drilling.</p>
</text>
